---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Ideas & Partnerships — Vasile Grafu" description="Product ideas in applied AI and logistics looking for partners, co-founders, and early customers.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Ideas & Partnerships</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
    I’m an engineer who has spent 20 years turning business problems into running systems — and I
    have a pipeline of product ideas I want to build with the right partners. If you’re an
    investor, potential co-founder, or a company with a problem in one of these areas, let’s talk.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Applied AI for enterprises</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Agentic assistants grounded in a company’s own data — the architecture I build at scale
        today: multi-agent orchestration, RAG pipelines, and tool integration that actually ships.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Logistics & delivery technology</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Two decades in transport-administration software taught me where the friction still lives
        in parcel delivery, carrier integration, and e-commerce shipping.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">AI-assisted engineering practice</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        I use AI tools in every aspect of my work and lead teams through that transition. I’m
        interested in products and consulting that help engineering organizations do the same.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/40 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900 p-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Interested?</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
      Specific concepts and pitch decks are shared in private conversations.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/contact/"
      class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-white font-medium hover:bg-indigo-700"
    >
      Contact me
    </a>
  </div>
</Base>
